## PROPRIETARY & CLOSED-SOURCE NOTICE: OBSX SENTINEL™

The **OBSX Sentinel™ Adaptive Vector Circuit Breaker Engine** (autonomous vector isolation, distributed zero-day threat correlation, dynamic saturation throttling, real-time edge heuristics, and vector state machines) is **STRICTLY CLOSED SOURCE AND PROPRIETARY INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY**.

- **Not Included in this Repository:** Sentinel™ is **NOT** included in this public repository and is **NOT** licensed under the MIT License, Elastic License 2.0, or Part 2 below.
- **Private Repository & Cloud Exclusive:** Sentinel™ is maintained separately (`jidiotspam-hue/obsx-sentinel`) under the *OBSX Sentinel™ Enterprise Proprietary Software License* and operates as the managed service powering **https://obsx.tech**.
- **No Unauthorized Impersonation, API Abuse, or Proprietary Shims:** Nothing in Zone 1 or Zone 2 grants any license, patent right, or trademark right to Sentinel™. You may **NOT** copy, decompile, extract, or bypass Sentinel™ proprietary software, impersonate official OBSX Sentinel™ nodes, or distribute modules marketed as drop-in replacements for proprietary Sentinel™ services without a commercial agreement.
- **Self-Hosting Independence:** Self-hosted deployments from this repository execute the complete, standalone OBSX Core verification engine (Zone 1) with operator scaffolding (Zone 2) without requiring Sentinel™.

